- Split bundle (maplibre/motion/react), lazy-load globe, add ErrorBoundary
- Persist/detect language, localize aria-labels
- Fix favicon, add og.jpg, icons, manifest, fix JSON-LD placeholder
- Remove unused deps (three, genai, express, dotenv, tsx, autoprefixer)
- Add GitHub Actions CI, vercel.json headers, rewrite README

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
